{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a popular Blackjack-like game, you are trapped with a mysterious figure on a TV and forced to play against it, until the final stage. Draw cards and collect coins, risking a bust, use the objects to take an advantage on the dealer and you might reach the end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D \u2013 to look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click \u2013 Select / Use / Continue dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click \u2013 Inspect card/object</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOALS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the dealer\u2019s score without going over 7.5 points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click in front of you or on the deck to draw a card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the red button to pass and end the round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win as many rounds as possible until the end</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYING TIME:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ 20 minutes (with a bit of luck)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732480?t=1754489318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732480?t=1754489318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732480/9f9d7a07e1723f27baa955ff6ea3296692446bbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754489318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732480/9f9d7a07e1723f27baa955ff6ea3296692446bbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754489318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":